# Stage-2 Water Linked official-default-aligned DVL-only contract.
#
# Assumptions forced by unavailable real-vehicle artifacts:
# - BlueOS extension uses POSITION_DELTA with DVL_DOWN/body-FRD axes.
# - DVL acoustic origin is treated as base_link and VISO_POS remains zero.
# - No artificial transport queue is invented. The extension does not set
#   VISO_DELAY_MS; pin this ArduPilot build's unmodified 10 ms default.
# - Flat-bottom altitude is also sent as DISTANCE_SENSOR, matching the
#   extension's default rangefinder=true behavior.
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3
EK2_ENABLE 0
EK3_ENABLE 1
VISO_TYPE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 0
EK3_SRC1_YAW 1
VISO_DELAY_MS 10
VISO_ORIENT 0
VISO_POS_X 0
VISO_POS_Y 0
VISO_POS_Z 0
RNGFND1_TYPE 10
SIM_GPS_DISABLE 1
GPS1_TYPE 0
GPS2_TYPE 0
